messages.text:
"Hier ist der Code meiner Webseite für Live-TV und Live-Radio (eine einzige index.html).

Aufgabe:
- Übernimm Design, Aufbau und Funktionen genau so, wie sie sind.
- Radio: Hörer hören einen Musik-Stream. Wenn der Admin live spricht, wird die Musik ausgeblendet und die Hörer hören das Mikrofon (WebRTC über PeerJS). Danach läuft die Musik automatisch weiter.
- TV: Player für HLS (.m3u8), mp4, YouTube und Twitch.
- Admin-Bereich mit Passwort-Login, \"Live gehen\"-Knopf, Pegelanzeige, Mikrofonauswahl und Eingabe der Stream-Links.
- Alles muss kostenlos laufen und auf Netlify oder GitHub Pages funktionieren (HTTPS).

Ändere nichts am Design, außer ich sage es ausdrücklich.
Bitte behebe zuerst diesen Fehler: Im Admin erscheint \"Studio ist noch nicht verbunden\".

<!doctype html>
<html lang=\"de\">
<head>
<meta charset=\"utf-8\">
<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover\">
<title>MeinSender – Live TV @COMMENT_BODY@ Radio</title>
<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Live TV und Live Radio rund um die Uhr – Musik, Moderation und Programm in einem Sender.\">
<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#07090d\">
<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"MeinSender – Live TV @COMMENT_BODY@ Radio\">
<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Live TV und Live Radio rund um die Uhr.\">
<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">
<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='16' fill='%23ff5a4e'/%3E%3Cpath d='M14 32h6m6-12v24m6-32v40m6-28v16m6-8h6' stroke='%23fff' stroke-width='5' stroke-linecap='round' fill='none'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#07090d; --bg2:#0b0e15; --surface:#0f131c; --surface2:#151a26;
  --line:rgba(255,255,255,.08); --line2:rgba(255,255,255,.14);
  --text:#f3f1ee; --mute:#9aa1b3; --dim:#6b7285;
  --live:#ff4b3e; --amber:#ffb347; --ok:#3ecf8e;
  --grad:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff5a4e 0%,#ff8a4c 55%,#ffb347 100%);
  --r:20px; --max:1180px;
  --font:system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,\"Helvetica Neue\",Arial,sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;scroll-padding-top:80px}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font:16px/1.6 var(--font);padding-bottom:96px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
button,input,select{font:inherit;color:inherit}
button{cursor:pointer;border:0;background:none}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.hidden{display:none!important}
.wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 22px}
:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--amber);outline-offset:3px}

/* Navigation */
.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:30;background:rgba(7,9,13,.78);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:68px;gap:18px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-weight:800;font-size:1.15rem;letter-spacing:.01em}
.logo svg{width:34px;height:34px;flex:none}
.menu{display:none;gap:30px;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--mute);font-weight:500}
.menu a:hover{color:var(--text)}
@media(min-width:820px){.menu{display:flex}}
.badge{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:99px;border:1px solid var(--line2);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--mute);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
.badge i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--dim)}
.badge.on{background:var(--live);border-color:var(--live);color:#fff}
.badge.on i{background:#fff;animation:pulse 1.1s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{50%{opacity:.2}}

/* Hero */
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:56px 0 70px;background:
  radial-gradient(900px 480px at 85% -10%,rgba(255,90,78,.20),transparent 60%),
  radial-gradient(700px 420px at -10% 20%,rgba(255,179,71,.10),transparent 60%),var(--bg)}
.hero::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--line) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:56px 56px;mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0,#000 0,transparent 70%);-webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0,#000 0,transparent 70%);opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}
.hero .wrap{position:relative;display:grid;gap:44px;align-items:center}
@media(min-width:1000px){.hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:5fr 7fr;gap:56px}.hero{padding:84px 0 96px}}
.eyebrow{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--amber);margin-bottom:18px}
.eyebrow::before{content:\"\";width:26px;height:2px;background:var(--grad);border-radius:2px}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5.4vw,3.8rem);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:800}
h1 em{font-style:normal;background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.lead{color:var(--mute);font-size:1.1rem;margin-top:20px;max-width:34em}
.cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:30px}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:99px;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;transition:transform .12s,background .2s,border-color .2s}
.btn:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.btn.primary{background:var(--grad);color:#1a0d05}
.btn.ghost{border:1px solid var(--line2);background:rgba(255,255,255,.03)}
.btn.ghost:hover{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.3)}
.btn svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:currentColor}

/* TV player */
.stage{position:relative;border-radius:var(--r);padding:1px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(255,255,255,.22),rgba(255,255,255,.04) 40%,rgba(255,90,78,.25));box-shadow:0 40px 90px -30px rgba(255,90,78,.28)}
.screen{position:relative;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:calc(var(--r) - 1px);overflow:hidden;background:#000}
.screen video,.screen iframe{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;background:#000}
.poster{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;background:
  radial-gradient(600px 300px at 50% 40%,rgba(255,90,78,.28),transparent 70%),linear-gradient(160deg,#141a28,#0a0d14)}
.poster-in{text-align:center}
.bigplay{width:84px;height:84px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--grad);display:grid;place-items:center;margin:0 auto 14px;box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(255,90,78,.45);transition:transform .15s}
.bigplay:hover{transform:scale(1.07)}
.bigplay svg{width:32px;height:32px;fill:#1a0d05;margin-left:4px}
.poster small{display:block;color:var(--mute);font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.08em}
.chip{position:absolute;top:14px;left:14px;z-index:2;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);backdrop-filter:blur(6px);padding:5px 12px;border-radius:99px;font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em}
.chip i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--live);animation:pulse 1.4s infinite}
.tvmsg{color:var(--mute);font-size:.85rem;margin-top:12px;min-height:1.3em;padding-left:4px}

/* Sections */
section.block{padding:84px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
section.alt{background:var(--bg2)}
.sec-head{margin-bottom:38px;max-width:40em}
.sec-head .eyebrow{margin-bottom:12px}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.4vw,2.4rem);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-weight:800}
.sec-head p{color:var(--mute);margin-top:12px}

/* Radio card */
.radio-card{display:grid;gap:30px;background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--surface2),var(--surface));border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:34px}
@media(min-width:860px){.radio-card{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;align-items:center;padding:44px}}
.eq{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:flex-end;height:110px}
.eq span{flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-radius:6px;height:10%;transition:background .3s}
.playing .eq span{background:var(--amber);animation:eq 1.1s ease-in-out infinite}
.liveon.playing .eq span{background:var(--live)}
.eq span:nth-child(2n){animation-delay:.14s!important}.eq span:nth-child(3n){animation-delay:.28s!important}.eq span:nth-child(5n){animation-delay:.42s!important}.eq span:nth-child(7n){animation-delay:.56s!important}
@keyframes eq{0%,100%{height:12%}50%{height:100%}}
.rstatus{font-size:1.6rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.rsub{color:var(--mute);font-size:.9rem;margin-top:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.rsub::before{content:\"\";width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--dim)}
.rsub.ok::before{background:var(--ok)}
.rrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;margin-top:26px}
.circle{width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--grad);display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none;box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgba(255,90,78,.35);transition:transform .12s}
.circle:active{transform:scale(.93)}
.circle svg{width:28px;height:28px;fill:#1a0d05}
input[type=range]{accent-color:var(--amber);height:30px;flex:1;min-width:0}

/* Schedule */
.sched{display:grid;gap:14px}
@media(min-width:700px){.sched{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
@media(min-width:1040px){.sched{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
.slot{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:22px;position:relative;transition:border-color .2s,transform .2s}
.slot:hover{border-color:var(--line2);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.slot time{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--amber)}
.slot h3{font-size:1.1rem;margin:8px 0 6px}
.slot p{color:var(--mute);font-size:.92rem}
.slot.now{border-color:rgba(255,90,78,.6);background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(255,90,78,.12),var(--surface))}
.slot.now::after{content:\"JETZT\";position:absolute;top:18px;right:18px;background:var(--live);color:#fff;font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:99px}

/* About */
.about{display:grid;gap:36px}
@media(min-width:900px){.about{grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:64px;align-items:center}}
.about p{color:var(--mute);font-size:1.05rem;margin-top:16px}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px}
.stat-b{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:22px 14px;text-align:center}
.stat-b b{display:block;font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:800;background:var(--grad);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.stat-b span{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--mute)}

/* Footer */
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:46px 0 30px;background:var(--bg2)}
.fgrid{display:grid;gap:28px}
@media(min-width:760px){.fgrid{grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr 1fr}}
.flinks{display:grid;gap:8px;color:var(--mute);font-size:.92rem}
.flinks a:hover{color:var(--text)}
footer h4{font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:12px}
.fine{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:34px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--dim);font-size:.82rem}
.fine button{color:var(--dim);text-decoration:underline;font-size:.82rem}

/* Sticky player bar */
.bar{position:fixed;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;z-index:40;background:rgba(10,12,18,.88);backdrop-filter:blur(18px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(18px);border-top:1px solid var(--line2);padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom)}
body.liveon .bar{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,75,62,.28),rgba(10,12,18,.9) 60%)}
.bar .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;height:76px}
.bar .mini{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--grad);display:grid;place-items:center;flex:none}
.bar .mini svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:#1a0d05}
.bar .info{flex:1;min-width:0}
.bar .info b{display:block;font-size:.95rem;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.bar .info span{display:block;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--mute);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
.bar .volw{display:none;width:140px;align-items:center}
@media(min-width:700px){.bar .volw{display:flex}}
.tap{position:fixed;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);bottom:92px;z-index:41;background:var(--live);color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:99px;box-shadow:0 14px 36px rgba(255,75,62,.5);font-size:.92rem;max-width:calc(100% - 32px)}

/* Admin */
#admin{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:60;background:rgba(3,4,7,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);overflow:auto;padding:20px}
.panel{max-width:580px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:var(--r);padding:26px}
.ph{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:18px}
.ph h3{font-size:1.2rem}
.x{background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:7px 13px;font-size:.82rem}
.sec{background:var(--surface2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;margin-top:14px}
.sec h5{font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);margin-bottom:12px}
label{display:block;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--mute);margin:12px 0 6px}
input[type=text],input[type=password],input[type=url],select{width:100%;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:10px;padding:11px 12px}
.abtn{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line2);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 16px;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem}
.abtn.main{background:var(--grad);border:0;color:#1a0d05}
.golive{width:100%;padding:22px;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:800;border-radius:16px;background:var(--live);color:#fff;letter-spacing:.04em}
.golive.stop{background:#fff;color:#111}
.stat{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--mute)}
.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--dim);flex:none}
.dot.ok{background:var(--ok)}.dot.bad{background:var(--live)}
.meter{height:12px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;margin-top:14px}
.meter div{height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--ok),var(--amber),var(--live));transition:width .06s}
.two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
.note{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--dim);margin-top:8px}
code{background:var(--bg);padding:2px 6px;border-radius:6px;font-size:.78rem;word-break:break-all}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>
</head>
<body id=\"top\">

<header class=\"nav\">
  <div class=\"wrap\">
    <a class=\"logo\" href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"Startseite\">
      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"64\" height=\"64\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#ff5a4e\"/><path d=\"M14 32h6m6-12v24m6-32v40m6-28v16m6-8h6\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></svg>
      <span id=\"brand\">MeinSender</span>
    </a>
    <nav class=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Hauptmenü\">
      <a href=\"#tv\">Live TV</a><a href=\"#radio\">Radio</a><a href=\"#programm\">Programm</a><a href=\"#about\">Über uns</a>
    </nav>
    <div class=\"badge\" id=\"badge\"><i></i><b id=\"badgeTxt\">MUSIK</b></div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- HERO + TV -->
<section class=\"hero\" id=\"tv\">
  <div class=\"wrap\">
    <div>
      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Live · TV @COMMENT_BODY@amp; Radio</div>
      <h1 id=\"heroTitle\">Dein Sender. <em>Live.</em> Rund um die Uhr.</h1>
      <p class=\"lead\" id=\"heroSub\">Fernsehen, Radio und Moderation live an einem Ort – ohne Anmeldung, auf jedem Gerät.</p>
      <div class=\"cta\">
        <button class=\"btn primary\" id=\"ctaTv\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg>TV starten</button>
        <button class=\"btn ghost\" id=\"ctaRadio\">Radio hören</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class=\"stage\">
        <div class=\"screen\">
          <div class=\"chip\"><i></i>LIVE</div>
          <div id=\"tvView\"></div>
          <div class=\"poster\" id=\"tvPoster\">
            <div class=\"poster-in\">
              <button class=\"bigplay\" id=\"tvStart\" aria-label=\"TV starten\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg></button>
              <small>LIVE TV STARTEN</small>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class=\"tvmsg\" id=\"tvMsg\"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- RADIO -->
<section class=\"block alt\" id=\"radio\">
  <div class=\"wrap\">
    <div class=\"sec-head\">
      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Live Radio</div>
      <h2>Musik und Moderation – ohne Pause.</h2>
      <p>Zwischen der Musik meldet sich unser Studio live. Danach läuft die Musik automatisch weiter.</p>
    </div>
    <div class=\"radio-card\">
      <div class=\"eq\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
      <div>
        <div class=\"rstatus\" id=\"rStatus\">Bereit – tippe auf Play</div>
        <div class=\"rsub\" id=\"rLink\">Verbinde mit Studio …</div>
        <div class=\"rrow\">
          <button class=\"circle\" id=\"playBtn\" aria-label=\"Radio abspielen oder pausieren\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"pl-icon\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg></button>
          <input type=\"range\" class=\"volctl\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.8\" aria-label=\"Lautstärke\">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROGRAMM -->
<section class=\"block\" id=\"programm\">
  <div class=\"wrap\">
    <div class=\"sec-head\">
      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Sendeplan</div>
      <h2>Unser Programm</h2>
      <p>Was heute bei uns läuft. Die aktuelle Sendung ist markiert.</p>
    </div>
    <div class=\"sched\" id=\"schedule\"></div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ÜBER UNS -->
<section class=\"block alt\" id=\"about\">
  <div class=\"wrap about\">
    <div>
      <div class=\"eyebrow\">Über uns</div>
      <h2 id=\"aboutTitle\">Ein Sender für alle.</h2>
      <p id=\"aboutText\"></p>
    </div>
    <div class=\"stats\">
      <div class=\"stat-b\"><b>24/7</b><span>Live-Programm</span></div>
      <div class=\"stat-b\"><b>TV+Radio</b><span>in einem Sender</span></div>
      <div class=\"stat-b\"><b>0 €</b><span>für Hörer</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class=\"wrap\">
    <div class=\"fgrid\">
      <div>
        <a class=\"logo\" href=\"#top\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"64\" height=\"64\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"#ff5a4e\"/><path d=\"M14 32h6m6-12v24m6-32v40m6-28v16m6-8h6\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\"/></svg><span id=\"brand2\">MeinSender</span></a>
        <p style=\"color:var(--mute);font-size:.92rem;margin-top:14px;max-width:26em\" id=\"footTag\">Live TV und Radio – rund um die Uhr.</p>
      </div>
      <div><h4>Entdecken</h4><div class=\"flinks\"><a href=\"#tv\">Live TV</a><a href=\"#radio\">Radio</a><a href=\"#programm\">Programm</a><a href=\"#about\">Über uns</a></div></div>
      <div><h4>Kontakt @COMMENT_BODY@amp; Rechtliches</h4><div class=\"flinks\"><a id=\"mailLink\" href=\"#\">E-Mail</a><a id=\"impLink\" href=\"#\">Impressum</a><a id=\"dsLink\" href=\"#\">Datenschutz</a></div></div>
    </div>
    <div class=\"fine\"><span id=\"copy\"></span><button id=\"adminOpen\">Admin</button></div>
  </div>
</footer>

<!-- Sticky Radio-Player -->
<button class=\"tap hidden\" id=\"tapBar\">Live-Sendung läuft – hier tippen zum Mithören</button>
<div class=\"bar\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Radio-Player\">
  <div class=\"wrap\">
    <button class=\"mini\" id=\"barPlay\" aria-label=\"Radio abspielen oder pausieren\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"pl-icon\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg></button>
    <div class=\"info\"><b id=\"barStatus\">Bereit – tippe auf Play</b><span id=\"barSub\">Live Radio</span></div>
    <div class=\"volw\"><input type=\"range\" class=\"volctl\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.8\" aria-label=\"Lautstärke\"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ADMIN -->
<div id=\"admin\" class=\"hidden\">
  <div class=\"panel\">

    <div id=\"loginView\">
      <div class=\"ph\"><h3>Admin-Login</h3><button class=\"x\" data-close>Schließen</button></div>
      <label for=\"pw\">Passwort</label>
      <input type=\"password\" id=\"pw\" autocomplete=\"current-password\">
      <div class=\"note\" id=\"loginMsg\"></div>
      <div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"abtn main\" id=\"loginBtn\">Anmelden</button></div>
